# Business Project Coding Rules

Use the existing approved project rules and enterprise standards; this extension cannot override them. Before the first relevant write, decide acceptance, scope, actual paths/names/dependencies, API/field contracts and checks. Read the confirmed project profile, common rules and task-specific stack references. Do not guess versions or create a parallel layout.

Preserve existing edits/generated inputs, protect credentials and private data, prevent unsafe SQL/deserialization and server-side authorization gaps. Never weaken tests to pass or publish without authorization. Report real checks and gaps. MCP/A2A are optional and disabled.

